      "id": "philips_tpv",
      "title": "Philips Google TV (TPV)",
      "notes": "From device report #3. Tested: series OLED888 in 65 inch (65OLED888/12, platform Philips Google TV TA1 / PH1M_WW_9972, MediaTek mt5896, Android 12); other sizes and series with the same remote should fit. The app buttons are Philips global keys: the TV still runs their factory function (e.g. the Play Store page of a disabled app) even when the app intercepts them. The TV button and the microphone both send keycode 811 (scan codes 0x2ff and 0xd9), so they can only be assigned together; by default both keep their factory function.",
